   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I like / I like (plural)",
     "texto": [
      "With **нравиться**, the person is in the dative and what is liked is in the nominative: **Мне нравится природа** (I like nature), **тебе нравится фильм** (you like the film).",
      "If what is liked is plural, the verb goes in the plural: **Мне нравятся картины** (I like the paintings)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The dative pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "**мне** (to me), **тебе** (to you), **ему** (to him), **ей** (to her), **нам** (to us), **вам** (to you, formal or plural), **им** (to them).",
      "If what is liked is an action, the verb goes in the infinitive: **Мне нравится читать** (I like reading)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
